  <item>
    <title>与容貌焦虑和解失败！就做不了人了!?</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/66c58794db5e6d6bf9dbe912</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">66c58794db5e6d6bf9dbe912</guid>
    <pubDate>Wed, 21 Aug 2024 06:22:12 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>伴随着蝉鸣声 听完别人的焦虑 我突然就不焦虑了</span></p><span></span><p><span>节目里仅分享个人经历和感受~</span></p><span></span><p><span>本期主播：蛋黄 果果</span></p><span></span><p><span>【🎧收听指南】</span></p><span></span><p><strong><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="32">00:32</a> &nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;回想自己从什么时候开始容貌焦虑</span></strong></p><span></span><p><strong><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="142">02:22</a> &nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;为什么面对校园“时尚”会引发容貌焦虑？</span></strong></p><span></span><p><strong><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="251">04:11</a> &nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;从小学开始因为换牙出现了容貌焦虑&nbsp;</span></strong></p><span></span><p><strong><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="398">06:38</a> &nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;自己烦恼的已久的“缺陷”别人都没那么注意</span></strong></p><span></span><p><strong><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="409">06:49</a> &nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;因为发育过早而焦虑 恨自己为什么长那么快</span></strong></p><span></span><p><strong><span>&nbsp;<a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="536">08:56</a> &nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;从小留短发长得像男孩被迫去了男厕所</span></strong></p><span></span><p><strong><span>&nbsp;<a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="737">12:17</a> &nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;小时候都有留过短发被误认“小哥哥”的经历</span></strong></p><span></span><p><strong><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="892">14:52</a> &nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;开始意识到体重困扰</span></strong></p><span></span><p><strong><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1110">18:30</a> &nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;高中毕业拍毕业照意识到自己“难看”</span></strong></p><span></span><p><strong><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1132">18:52</a> &nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;因为容貌焦虑还去开了个双眼皮</span></strong></p><span></span><p><strong><span>&nbsp;<a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1740">29:00</a> &nbsp;&nbsp;青春期后不爱拍照</span></strong></p><span></span><p><strong><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1787">29:47</a> &nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;拍照的心路历程</span></strong></p><span></span><p><strong><span>&nbsp;<a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2042">34:02</a> &nbsp;&nbsp;有很多自认为的“缺陷”也是可以改善的</span></strong></p><span></span><p><strong><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2208">36:48</a> &nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;上了个综艺但不敢面对镜头前的自己&nbsp;</span></strong></p><span></span><p><strong><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2297">38:17</a> &nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;被玩飞盘的小姐姐鼓励到</span></strong></p><span></span><p><strong><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2674">44:34</a> &nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;虽然但是还没有办法接受少年白</span></strong></p><span></span><p><strong><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2959">49:19</a> &nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;审美一直在变化 时尚的轮回又会转回来的</span></strong></p><span></span><p><strong><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3055">50:55</a> &nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;给现在的容貌焦虑程度打分</span></strong></p><span></span><p><strong><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3214">53:34</a> &nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;接受“暂时还是无法接受的自己” 都交给时间吧</span></strong></p>]]></description>
    <enclosure url="https://media.xyzcdn.net/lrBi_sftIXGRoOy3SSI6v0d0pma5.m4a" length="53642902" type="audio/mp4"/>
    <itunes:duration>00:55:16</itunes:duration>
    <itunes:image href="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FlVaG8fdzLQXLQnrNCMFkrlrx_pF.jpg"/>
    <itunes:explicit>false</itunes:explicit>
  </item>
  <item>
    <title>领导差点以为我为了逃避工作摔断了胳膊</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/66a5238b7349f7a557f61890</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">66a5238b7349f7a557f61890</guid>
    <pubDate>Sat, 27 Jul 2024 23:00:00 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>最近又又又进入低谷期啦！</span></p><span></span><p><span>不过谁还没有几个波峰谷底呢？</span></p><span></span><p><span>别怕别怕，今天跟我们来一起聊聊过去从曾经有哪些从谷底走出来的神奇转折事件吧！</span></p><span></span><p><span>这其实并不是一期如何走出低谷期的行为指南，每次试图重新按照过去的经验自救的时候，我也往往发现它并不奏效。</span></p><span></span><p><span>但是哪怕能从中获得一些小小的勇气和灵感也是好的呀！</span></p><span></span><p><strong><span>【🎙本期陪伴】</span></strong></p><span></span><p><span>🍎果果：不会咖啡的烘焙师不是好版画师</span></p><span></span><p><span>小红书：一只野生果</span></p><span></span><p><span>🍳蛋黄：正在探索日语以外可能性的前日企互联网OL</span></p><span></span><p><span>小红书：蛋黄MAYOKO</span></p><span></span><p><span>公众号：自由命题</span></p><span></span><p><strong><span>【🎧收听指南】</span></strong></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="110">01:50</a> 去年初夏重新探索了家附近，居然还有新发现</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="365">06:05</a> 不写to do list，改成了done list</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="478">07:58</a> 简单做个菜有时也可以打破焦虑状态</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="677">11:17</a> 进入心流的时候会感觉内心很充实</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="856">14:16</a> 濒临彻底崩溃，被朋友的一个电话拯救了</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1097">18:17</a> 逼自己太狠的时候，连运动也开心不起来了</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1304">21:44</a> 并不是只有快乐才是正常的</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1501">25:01</a> 一段唏嘘的恋爱经历：“不要试图等待一个拯救者”</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1919">31:59</a> 恐惧和压力让我每天上班前会在附近地铁站坐很久发呆</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2174">36:14</a> “不要怕”</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2283">38:03</a> 很多人的追星其实是一种精神寄托</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2557">42:37</a> 那次骨折是我2022年最美好的回忆</span></p><span></span><p><strong><span>【💡果果最近刻的版画】</span></strong></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/lippESgcwkJbjZb3gHk54V4P7pAh.jpg"></figure><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/liESGCMF_RV7dDTa_RzNNxcw-gGD.png"></figure><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/Fiy7oj__cTVdOx4ZGhSxG3hBVpZp.jpg"></figure>]]></description>
    <enclosure url="https://media.xyzcdn.net/lnZjS3aZFpX4AGsEK77Xi9_WV6KA.m4a" length="49938264" type="audio/mp4"/>
    <itunes:duration>00:50:49</itunes:duration>
    <itunes:image href="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FlVaG8fdzLQXLQnrNCMFkrlrx_pF.jpg"/>
    <itunes:explicit>false</itunes:explicit>
  </item>
  <item>
    <title>真是要命！怎么录完这期又买买买！</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/6620d4f05dae7932c64ebd2e</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">6620d4f05dae7932c64ebd2e</guid>
    <pubDate>Thu, 18 Apr 2024 08:08:15 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>在消费降级之际，</span></p><span></span><p><span>这期想和大家聊聊曾经因为冲动花的冤枉钱</span></p><span></span><p><span>Pdd、淘宝凑单、买一送一、总想花钱的念头，</span></p><span></span><p><span>在生活中无时无刻伴随我们左右。</span></p><span></span><p><span>我们要如何控制消费欲？怎样拒绝冲动消费呢？</span></p><span></span><p><span>方法可以是多变的，适合自己最重要。</span></p><span></span><p><span>在后悔的消费体验里总结经验，一些表达纯属个人观点。</span></p><span></span><p><span>如果大家身上也有冲动消费的趣事，</span></p><span></span><p><span>欢迎评论区和我们互动哦~</span></p><span></span><h2><br></h2><span></span><p><strong><span>🎧收听指南：</span></strong></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="30">00:30</a> &nbsp;在衣物上花费的冤枉钱</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="110">01:50</a> 搬去东京后维持着可怕的消费习惯</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="346">05:46</a> 因为工作压力过大情绪上头消费了</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="747">12:27</a> 很容易在优衣库里冲动消费</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="906">15:06</a> 从山形搬到东京后，买了近28万日元的洗衣机</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1275">21:15</a> 因为“羞耻心”买了两双运动鞋</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1522">25:22</a> 同样因为“羞耻心”买的化妆品</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1721">28:41</a> 上班后想用好的护肤品</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1915">31:55</a> 冷静下来想想为什么会冲动消费</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2080">34:40</a> 淘宝满减的诱惑</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2239">37:19</a> 日本消费税变增的前一天买了switch+卡带</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2371">39:31</a> 怎样控制消费欲望</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2460">41:00</a> 容易在直播间下单</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2512">41:52</a> 回国后消费观的改变</span></p>]]></description>
    <enclosure url="https://media.xyzcdn.net/lqVf_GPU2-GFwcdSWGC81UNpwyL6.m4a" length="57945267" type="audio/mp4"/>
    <itunes:duration>00:59:42</itunes:duration>
    <itunes:image href="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FlVaG8fdzLQXLQnrNCMFkrlrx_pF.jpg"/>
    <itunes:explicit>false</itunes:explicit>
  </item>
  <item>
    <title>我妈跟我说，咱家冬天真的囤了300斤大白菜</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/6606ecf61519139e4f704992</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">6606ecf61519139e4f704992</guid>
    <pubDate>Fri, 29 Mar 2024 16:31:50 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>东北是不是没有i人？上海人是不是都很精明？</span></p><span></span><p><span>地域刻板印象好像一直都是一个躲不过去的问题。</span></p><span></span><p><span>可不可以不要再给我贴标签啦！</span></p><span></span><p><span>但仔细想想，自己或多或少也会透过一些滤镜去看过别人。</span></p><span></span><p><span>今天来一起聊聊各自身边虚虚实实的地域刻板印象吧。</span><br><span> </span><br><span> </span><strong><span>🎧收听指南：</span></strong><br><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="112">1:52</a>被嫌弃的东北子女的一生</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="687">11:27</a>听说找了个上海女朋友，他爸妈一开始有点紧张</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1119">18:39</a>有的时候觉得标签的本质其实是一种归纳总结</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1183">19:43</a>反思一下，自己也玩过地域梗</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1272">21:12</a>东北的澡堂文化</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1490">24:50</a>“总是会觉得温州人很聪明很会做生意”</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1687">28:07</a>曾经我也以为传说太夸张，直到我妈说家里真的囤了几百斤白菜</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2058">34:18</a>我觉得地域刻板印象的判定主要取决于听话人</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2143">35:43</a>聊聊江浙菜的甜和东北菜的重油盐</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2668">44:28</a>黑龙江人：放了番茄酱的锅包肉要开除锅包肉籍！</span></p><span></span><p><strong><span>🎵本期BGM：</span></strong><br><span>Walk by ikson:<a data-url="https://ikson.com/track/28/walk" href="https://ikson.com/track/28/walk">ikson.com</a></span></p>]]></description>
    <enclosure url="https://media.xyzcdn.net/llPR2YQX2Ebwt9VP1XREUYgbQOV2.m4a" length="34208338" type="audio/mp4"/>
    <itunes:duration>00:46:50</itunes:duration>
    <itunes:image href="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FlVaG8fdzLQXLQnrNCMFkrlrx_pF.jpg"/>
    <itunes:explicit>false</itunes:explicit>
  </item>
  <item>
    <title>咖啡是生活里的消耗品还是生活伴侣？</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/65eabf878e6f71a5b7d16730</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">65eabf878e6f71a5b7d16730</guid>
    <pubDate>Fri, 08 Mar 2024 07:34:31 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>如今咖啡已经不是小资西方饮品，渐渐成为了打工人必备品。五步一家咖啡馆的上海，早就已经开启内卷浪潮。与其聊懂不懂咖啡，不如尊重每个人独一无二的味觉体验。</span></p><span></span><p><span>本期播客中你将会听到：</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="44">00:44</a> &nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;每天都需要来一杯</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="128">02:08</a> &nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;喝咖啡量的变化</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="152">02:32</a> &nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;果果回顾咖啡馆打工体验</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="218">03:38</a> &nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;咖啡馆杯测，对于咖啡馆出品的要求</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="526">08:46</a> &nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;雀巢是对咖啡最早的认识</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="685">11:25</a> &nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;咖啡其实就是一个水果饮品</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="730">12:10</a> &nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;咖啡馆多了特调</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="870">14:30</a> &nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;日本星巴克和国内的区别</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1124">18:44</a> &nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;日本人的饮咖啡习惯</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1254">20:54</a> &nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;比起胶囊蛋黄更喜欢体验做咖啡的过程</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1296">21:36</a> &nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;开始接触胶囊</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1424">23:44</a> &nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;深烘豆没有想象的那么难喝</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1500">25:00</a> &nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;大多咖啡师是爱分享的 ，前提不忙的情况</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1630">27:10</a> &nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;果果的咖啡之路，从开始到放弃</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1994">33:14</a> &nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;咖啡馆都有自己的冲煮参数</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2160">36:00</a> &nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;对于咖啡风味的认知变化</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2353">39:13</a> &nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;酒香咖啡豆是放在酒桶里发酵的吗？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2506">41:46</a> &nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;对喝咖啡心态上的转变</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2697">44:57</a> &nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;开始体验在家磨豆子冲煮咖啡</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2820">47:00</a> &nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;星巴克早期不仅是一家咖啡，也象征着地位身份</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2901">48:21</a> &nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;现在星巴克更像是人际交往的小社区</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3419">56:59</a> &nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;如何发现一家好喝的咖啡馆</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3661">01:01:01</a> &nbsp;&nbsp;大家现在能接受的咖啡价格</span></p>]]></description>
    <enclosure url="https://media.xyzcdn.net/lprwZK_22K5cQ8kXuvo0Y-F2QRy-.m4a" length="61952001" type="audio/mp4"/>
    <itunes:duration>01:03:50</itunes:duration>
    <itunes:image href="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FlVaG8fdzLQXLQnrNCMFkrlrx_pF.jpg"/>
    <itunes:explicit>false</itunes:explicit>
  </item>
  <item>
    <title>离开了职场，却跑到景德镇996捏陶</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/65dc5e3a0847349e0caabc5b</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">65dc5e3a0847349e0caabc5b</guid>
    <pubDate>Mon, 26 Feb 2024 09:47:38 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>近些年经常会在社交媒体上刷看到不少人纷纷裸辞去景德镇学陶。</span></p><span></span><p><span>他们为什么想去？学陶有什么魅力？</span></p><span></span><p><span>——去景德镇之前我们内心也曾有一个预设的答案，然而当你亲自踏上那片土地，亲手从陶土开始制作一件自己的作品，那些内心曾经预设的答案似乎对又似乎不对。</span></p><span></span><p><span>希望我们的所见所感也能为你解答一部分对于景德镇的好奇心，也希望我们内心的收获可以分享并传递给正在听播客的你。</span></p><span></span><h2><span>本期播客中你将会听到：</span></h2><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="71">01:11</a> 为什么会去景德镇</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="549">09:09</a> “你收获了什么？”</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="745">12:25</a> 比上班还卷，学陶艺是个体力活？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1328">22:08</a> 想到“这也太美好了吧”忽然哭崩</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1554">25:54</a> 作品成功前的一百种夭折方式</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2438">40:38</a> 学陶让我看世界多了一个视角</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3273">54:33</a> 离开几个月后，依旧会怀念当时的状态</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3410">56:50</a> 对于想去景德镇学陶的人有什么建议</span></p>]]></description>
